  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "\"Killer Fish!!\" FISH is a Platformer Run & Gun Shooter where you play as an armed FISH violently exploring through multiple levels. The game features a funny, unique stylized artstyle that could get a chuckle out of you! Gameplay: As an armed FISH , your duty is to kill as many enemies and smack up that BOSS ! At the end of each level you will be awarded with MONEY you can use in the next level to purchase deadly firearms! Features: \"What does this game about a peculiar little armed fish have to offer me?\" Well, it’s packed with some seriously awesome and rad stuff like: Fish With Gun. Awesome Weapons. Weird but unique artstyle! Fun classic Run & Gun gameplay! Terrific Bosses .. And more!!"
  },
